    "rowKey": "Third Iteration\n\nTri-Planar Mass\nModified Heatsink\nAmalgamation Rounds\n↑Aberrant Combustion",
    "section": "Energy Slot Weapons",
    "snapshot": {
      "plain": "Void Battery-Powered Lightweight Scout Rifle\n\nFires a narrow Spread Shot of 4 Void Projectiles, each dealing 29 [14] Damage with a 1.69x Precision Multiplier.\n\nRefills 1 Ammo every 5 seconds. Firing resets the timer. Works even while stowed, but not while actively venting.\n[Reload] actively vents the core, increasing the refill rate. Active Refill Rate and Reload Animation scales with Reload Speed.\n\n[ADS] without firing gradually compresses the spread into an Amalgamation Round over 20 ticks in 1 second.\nAmalgamation Rounds deal 233% [18%] Increased Damage and highlight the enemy for the entire team for 5 seconds.\nAmalgam Round is still 4 Void Projectiles that each have the stated damage increase!\n\nThird Iteration deals 95% [6.7%] increased Spread Shot damage and 30% [6.7%] increased Amalgamation Round Damage to Highlighted Enemies.\n\nOn Marked Enemy Kill or Amalgamation Round Precision Kill:\nVoid Invisibility for 5+3.5 seconds and Truesight for 4 seconds.\n\n↑Aberrant Combustion: On Amagalmation Round Precision Kill:\nTarget explodes (twice, lol) in a Void Blast, inflicting weaken over 8 meters and then dealing up to 140 [?] Damage, down to 20% Damage over 5 meters.",
